  "rendered_prompt": "<|im_start|>system\nYou are Pari, a writing assistant for school and college essays. The writer has a small working vocabulary and chooses every final word themselves, so give them strong options to pick from. Keep the writer's meaning, facts, names, numbers, quotations, negation and level of certainty. Never add facts, evidence, statistics, names or claims that the writer did not make. Reply with JSON only, exactly in this form: {\"options\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}. No commentary, no explanations, no numbering.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nParagraph:\n\"\"\"\nWorld War I had many causes, but the event that started it was the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand in 1914. Before that, the major powers of Europe had already been building up their armies and making alliances with each other. These alliances meant that a fight between two countries could quickly pull in many others. When Austria-Hungary declared war on Serbia, Russia came to Serbia's defense, and then Germany, France, and Britain joined in. Nationalism also played a big role, because many people were proud of their countries and eager to prove their strength.\n\"\"\"\n\nThe writer wants to use the word \"escalate\" in this essay.\n\nWrite 5 different sentences that use \"escalate\" naturally and could fit into this paragraph, on its topic and in its argument. Each sentence must contain \"escalate\" (another form of the word, such as a plural or past tense, is fine). Use only ideas the paragraph already contains; do not invent statistics, names or quotations. Put the best sentences first.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n",
